function MaintenanceForBike({bike,onGarage}:{bike?:Bike;onGarage:()=>void}){const [events,setEvents]=useState<ServiceEvent[]>([]),[adding,setAdding]=useState(false),[error,setError]=useState(''),[busy,setBusy]=useState(false);const live=useRef(true);useEffect(()=>{live.current=true;return()=>{live.current=false}},[]);async function refresh(){if(bike)try{const data=await api<ServiceEvent[]>('/services?bike_id='+bike.id);if(live.current)setEvents(data.filter(e=>e.bike_id===bike.id));}catch(e){if(live.current)setError((e as Error).message)}}useEffect(()=>{setEvents([]);setError('');void refresh()},[bike?.id]);async function save(e:FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>){e.preventDefault();if(!bike)return;const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget);setBusy(true);try{const body={bike_id:bike.id,category:f.get('category'),performed_at:f.get('performed_at'),engine_hours:f.get('engine_hours')===''?null:Number(f.get('engine_hours')),notes:f.get('notes'),next_due_hours:f.get('next_due_hours')===''?null:Number(f.get('next_due_hours')),interval_source:f.get('interval_source')};await api('/services','POST',createSubmission(bike.user_id,'service-'+bike.id,body));finishCreate(bike.user_id,'service-'+bike.id);if(live.current){setAdding(false);await refresh();}}catch(e){if(live.current)setError((e as Error).message)}finally{if(live.current)setBusy(false)}}if(!bike)return <section className="panel"><Empty icon={Wrench} title="Give your service history a home." action={<Button onClick={onGarage}>Add your bike</Button>}>Add a motorcycle to begin recording engine hours, inspections and service.</Empty></section>;const due=events.filter(e=>e.next_due_hours!==null).filter((e,i,a)=>a.findIndex(x=>x.category===e.category)===i);return <><div className="stat-row"><section className="stat"><Clock3/><span>ENGINE HOURS</span><strong>{bike.engine_hours??'—'}</strong><small>Update in your garage</small></section><section className="stat"><Wrench/><span>SERVICES LOGGED</span><strong>{events.length}</strong><small>Logged for this motorcycle</small></section><section className="stat"><Gauge/><span>DUE SOON</span><strong>{due.length}</strong><small>Based on your intervals</small></section></div>{error&&<div className="error" role="alert">{error}</div>}<section className="panel"><div className="panel-title"><div><h2>Service history</h2><p className="subtle">{bike.model_year} {bike.manufacturer} {bike.model}</p></div><Button onClick={()=>setAdding(!adding)}><Plus size={16}/>Log service</Button></div>{adding&&<form onSubmit={save} className="service-form"><div className="form-grid"><Field label="What"><select name="category">{['Engine oil','Oil filter','Air filter','Valve inspection','Top end','Bottom end','Clutch','Spark plug','Coolant','Brake fluid','Fork service','Shock service','Chain / sprockets','Other inspection'].map(c=><option key={c}>{c}</option>)}</select></Field><Field label="Date"><input type="date" name="performed_at" required defaultValue={new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)}/></Field><Field label="Hours"><input name="engine_hours" type="number" min="0" step="0.1" placeholder="Unknown" defaultValue={bike.engine_hours??''}/></Field><Field label="Next due at (hours)"><input name="next_due_hours" type="number" min="0" step="0.1" placeholder="e.g. 45"/></Field></div><Field label="Why then (optional)"><input name="interval_source" maxLength={1000} placeholder="Every 15 hrs, my mechanic’s call…"/></Field><Field label="Notes"><textarea name="notes" rows={3} maxLength={4000} placeholder="Oil and filter, cleaned the screen"/></Field><div className="button-row"><Button type="submit" disabled={busy}>{busy?'Saving…':'Save'}</Button><Button secondary onClick={()=>setAdding(false)}>Cancel</Button></div></form>}{!events.length&&!adding?<Empty icon={Wrench} title="A clean service record starts here.">Log completed work and the hours it was performed. BAK won’t assume an interval without a recorded source.</Empty>:<div className="service-list">{events.map(e=><article key={e.id}><div className="service-icon"><Wrench size={20}/></div><div><h3>{e.category}</h3><span className="subtle">{new Date(e.performed_at).toLocaleDateString()} · {e.engine_hours===null?'Hours not recorded':`${e.engine_hours} hours`}</span>{e.notes&&<p className="plain-message">{e.notes}</p>}{e.next_due_hours!==null&&<p className="service-target">Next at {e.next_due_hours} hrs {bike.engine_hours!==null&&bike.engine_hours>=e.next_due_hours?'· due now':''}{e.interval_source&&<small>{e.interval_source}</small>}</p>}</div></article>)}</div>}</section></>}
function Specs(props:Parameters<typeof SpecsForBike>[0]){return <SpecsForBike key={JSON.stringify([props.bike?.user_id,props.bike?.id,props.bike?.updated_at])} {...props}/>}
function SpecsForBike({bike,onGarage}:{bike?:Bike;onGarage:()=>void}){
 const [claims,setClaims]=useState<Claim[]>([]),[error,setError]=useState(''),[loading,setLoading]=useState(false),[query,setQuery]=useState(''),[found,setFound]=useState<Claim[]|null>(null),[searching,setSearching]=useState(false),[group,setGroup]=useState('');
 useEffect(()=>{let live=true;setClaims([]);setError('');setFound(null);setQuery('');if(bike){setLoading(true);api<Claim[]>('/claims?bike_id='+bike.id).then(d=>{if(live)setClaims(d.filter(c=>c.manufacturer===bike.manufacturer&&c.model===bike.model&&c.model_year===bike.model_year&&c.variant===bike.variant&&c.region===bike.region&&c.status==='VERIFIED'&&!c.has_conflict))}).catch(e=>{if(live)setError(e.message)}).finally(()=>{if(live)setLoading(false)})}return()=>{live=false}},[bike?.id]);
 async function search(e:FormEvent){e.preventDefault();if(!bike)return;const q=query.trim();if(!q){setFound(null);return;}setSearching(true);setError('');try{setFound(await api<Claim[]>('/claims/search?bike_id='+bike.id+'&q='+encodeURIComponent(q)));}catch(err){setError((err as Error).message);}finally{setSearching(false);}}
 const label=(c:Claim)=>factLabel(c);
 const card=(c:Claim)=><article key={c.id}><span className="eyebrow">{label(c)} · {c.status}</span><h3>{c.statement}</h3><p>{c.model_year} · {c.variant} · {c.region}</p>{/^https?:\/\//.test(c.source_url)&&<a href={c.source_url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View source <ArrowUpRight size={14}/></a>}<small>{c.source_locator}</small></article>;
 const groups=new Map<string,Claim[]>();for(const c of claims){const k=label(c);groups.set(k,[...(groups.get(k)??[]),c]);}
 const ordered=[...groups.entries()].sort((a,b)=>a[0].localeCompare(b[0]));
 return <section className="panel"><div className="panel-title"><h2>{bike?`${bike.model_year} ${bike.manufacturer} ${bike.model}`:'Verified specifications'}</h2><ShieldCheck size={22}/></div>{error&&<div className="error" role="alert">{error}</div>}
  {loading?<p role="status">Checking verified evidence…</p>:!bike?<Empty icon={BookOpen} title="Specifications start with an exact match." action={<Button onClick={onGarage}>Open garage</Button>}>Select a model, year, variant and region to find applicable information.</Empty>:!claims.length?<Empty icon={BookOpen} title="No published specs for this bike yet.">Ask BAK instead. It’ll tell you what it knows for your bike and say plainly when a number isn’t confirmed.</Empty>:<>
   <form className="inline-form spec-search" onSubmit={search}><input aria-label="Search this bike’s verified specifications" value={query} onChange={e=>{setQuery(e.target.value);if(!e.target.value.trim())setFound(null);}} placeholder="Rear axle nut torque, valve clearance, fork rebound…"/><Button type="submit" disabled={searching||!query.trim()}>{searching?'Searching…':'Search'}</Button></form>
   <p className="subtle">{claims.length} verified records for this exact bike. Coverage is not complete; a value that isn’t here is unknown, not zero.</p>
   {found?(found.length?<div className="claim-list">{found.map(card)}</div>:<p className="notice">Nothing verified matches that for this exact bike. Try the wording a service manual would use.</p>)
   :<div className="assembly-list">{ordered.map(([name,items])=><div key={name} className={'assembly'+(group===name?' open':'')}><button className="assembly-head" aria-expanded={group===name} onClick={()=>setGroup(group===name?'':name)}><span style={{textTransform:'capitalize'}}>{name} <small className="subtle">{items.length}</small></span><ArrowRight size={15}/></button>{group===name&&<div className="claim-list">{items.slice(0,200).map(card)}{items.length>200&&<p className="subtle">Showing the first 200 of {items.length}. Search to narrow this group.</p>}</div>}</div>)}</div>}
  </>}</section>}
function Setup({bike,signedIn,onSignIn,onGarage,onAsk}:{bike?:Bike;signedIn:boolean;onSignIn:()=>void;onGarage:()=>void;onAsk:()=>void}){const [calc,setCalc]=useState('gearing'),[result,setResult]=useState('');function calculate(e:FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>){e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget),v=(s:string)=>Number(f.get(s));try{if(calc==='gearing'){const next=finalDrive(v('front'),v('rear'));setResult(`Final-drive ratio: ${next.toFixed(3)}:1. Change from your original gearing: ${gearingChange(v('oldFront'),v('oldRear'),v('front'),v('rear')).toFixed(2)}%. A higher ratio is shorter gearing.`)}else if(calc==='sag'){const sag=v('extended')-v('loaded'),percent=sagPercent(v('extended'),v('loaded'),v('travel'));setResult(`Measured sag: ${sag.toFixed(1)} mm · ${percent.toFixed(2)}% of travel. This is a measurement, not a model-specific target.`)}else{const speed=speedKmh(v('rpm'),v('primary'),v('gear'),v('front'),v('rear'),v('circumference')*25.4);setResult(`Theoretical speed: ${(speed/1.609344).toFixed(1)} mph. Assumes no tire slip and the entered rolling circumference.`)}}catch(e){setResult((e as Error).message)}}const fields:Record<string,[string,string][]>= {gearing:[['oldFront','Original front sprocket (teeth)'],['oldRear','Original rear sprocket (teeth)'],['front','New front sprocket (teeth)'],['rear','New rear sprocket (teeth)']],sag:[['extended','Fully extended measurement (mm)'],['loaded','Loaded measurement (mm)'],['travel','Verified wheel travel (mm)']],speed:[['rpm','Engine speed (RPM)'],['primary','Primary reduction ratio'],['gear','Selected gear ratio'],['front','Front sprocket (teeth)'],['rear','Rear sprocket (teeth)'],['circumference','Measured rolling circumference (inches)']]};return <><section className="panel calculator"><div className="panel-title"><div><h2>Workshop calculators</h2><p className="subtle">Quick math for gearing, sag and speed.</p></div><Gauge size={26}/></div><div className="tabs">{[['gearing','Gearing change'],['sag','Sag measurement'],['speed','Speed / RPM']].map(([k,l])=><button key={k} className={calc===k?'active':''} onClick={()=>{setCalc(k);setResult('')}}>{l}</button>)}</div><form onSubmit={calculate} key={calc}><div className="form-grid">{fields[calc].map(([k,l])=><Field key={k} label={l}><input name={k} required type="number" min="0.000001" max="1000000" step="any" placeholder="0" inputMode="decimal"/></Field>)}</div><Button type="submit">Calculate <ArrowRight size={16}/></Button>{result&&<output className="calculation-result">{result}</output>}</form></section><section className="panel ask-cta"><div><h2>Work through a setup change</h2><p className="subtle">Tell BAK what the bike is doing and get one change to try at a time, based on your build.</p></div><Button onClick={()=>bike?onAsk():signedIn?onGarage():onSignIn()}>{bike?'Ask BAK':'Add your bike first'}</Button></section></>}
function Account({session,onSignIn,onSignedOut}:{session:Session|null;onSignIn:()=>void;onSignedOut:()=>void}){const [entitlement,setEntitlement]=useState<Entitlement|null>(null),[error,setError]=useState(''),[busy,setBusy]=useState(false),[deleting,setDeleting]=useState(false),[confirmation,setConfirmation]=useState('');useEffect(()=>{if(session){api<Entitlement>('/entitlement').then(setEntitlement).catch(e=>setError(e.message));}},[session?.user.id]);async function exportData(){setBusy(true);try{const data=await api<unknown>('/account/export');const u=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([JSON.stringify(data,null,2)],{type:'application/json'}));const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='bakmx-account-export.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)}catch(e){setError((e as Error).message)}finally{setBusy(false)}}async function remove(){setBusy(true);try{await api('/account','DELETE',{confirmation});await supabase?.auth.signOut();onSignedOut()}catch(e){setError((e as Error).message)}finally{setBusy(false)}}if(!session)return <section className="panel"><Empty icon={ShieldCheck} title="Your own MX workshop." action={<Button onClick={onSignIn}>Sign in or create an account <ArrowRight size={16}/></Button>}>Save your motorcycles, service history and engineering conversations in one place.</Empty></section>;return <div className="account-layout">{error&&<div className="error" role="alert">{error}</div>}<section className="panel"><span className="eyebrow">RIDER ACCOUNT</span><h2>{session.user.email}</h2><p className="subtle">Your garage and service records stay connected to this account.</p><Button secondary onClick={async()=>{const r=await supabase?.auth.signOut();if(r?.error)setError(r.error.message);else onSignedOut()}}><LogOut size={16}/>Sign out</Button></section><Plans entitlement={entitlement}/><section className="panel"><h2>Your data</h2><p className="subtle">Download your records or permanently delete your account and associated data.</p><div className="button-row"><Button secondary disabled={busy} onClick={exportData}>Export my data</Button><button className="danger-link" onClick={()=>setDeleting(!deleting)}>Delete account</button></div>{deleting&&<div className="delete-box"><p>Permanently deletes your BAK MX data. Web membership is canceled. Apple/Google subscriptions must be managed separately in your store account. Type DELETE to confirm.</p><input aria-label="Type DELETE to confirm account deletion" value={confirmation} onChange={e=>setConfirmation(e.target.value)}/><Button disabled={busy||confirmation!=='DELETE'} onClick={remove}>Permanently delete account</Button></div>}</section></div>}

/** Apple 5.1.2(i): before the first Ask BAK question, say what goes to the AI provider and get the rider's permission. */
function AiConsent({onAgree,returning=false}:{onAgree:()=>void;returning?:boolean}){return <section className="panel ai-consent" aria-labelledby="ai-consent-title"><h3 id="ai-consent-title">{returning?aiConsentUpdatedTitle:aiConsentTitle}</h3>{returning&&<p>{aiConsentUpdatedIntro}</p>}<ul>{aiConsentPoints.map(p=><li key={p}>{p}</li>)}</ul><Button onClick={onAgree}>{aiConsentAgree}</Button></section>}
